      "evidence": "F2 gives the chain \"ζ^5=-ζ^4ζ=-ζ\" while also stating ζ^4=-1. In fact, -ζ^4ζ=ζ, whereas ζ^5=ζ^4ζ=-ζ. The stated chain contains a false equality even though the later residue-class table has the correct signs.",
      "severity": "fatal",
