      "location": "Statement",
      "defect": "ill-formed",
      "evidence": "The Statement factors the reduction in F_p[t] as ∏g_i^{a_i}, then writes P_i=(p,g_i(α)) in O_K. Here g_i has coefficients in F_p and α lies in the characteristic-zero ring O_K, so this evaluation is undefined without an integer-polynomial lift or an explicit definition as the preimage of the corresponding ideal in O_K/pO_K. This is readily fixed by specifying either convention.",
